    {q:"After a storm, a gully has formed on a bare slope and a fan of sand lies at the bottom. Name the process that formed the gully and the process that formed the fan of sand, and explain how they are connected.",memo:"Erosion formed the gully (running water carried soil and sand away). Deposition formed the fan of sand (the sand was dropped at the bottom where the water slowed). They are connected because the sand eroded from the slope is the sand deposited below.",r:{"all":[{"kw":["erosion|erode"]},{"kw":["deposit"]},{"kw":["carried|came from|washed|moved|same|because|then|link|connected|leads|result|which"]}]}},
