    {q:"Some people say: “Boys should not cry and girls should not play rough sports.” Explain why this belief is unfair.",memo:"It is unfair because it limits what people may do and feel. Everyone can have feelings and everyone can play any sport.",r:{"kw":["limit|stop them|equal|both|anyone|everyone|choice|abilit|talent|rights|should be able|can do|any chore|can play|can cook|can clean|can also|both can|free to|can cry|feelings"]}},
