    {q:"Eid-al-Fitr is celebrated by Muslims. What does it mark, and what is ONE way it is celebrated?",memo:"It marks the end of the fast of Ramadan. Ways it is celebrated: special prayers, family gatherings and feasting, giving to charity, wearing new clothes.",r:{"all":[{"kw":["ramadan|fast|fasting"]},{"kw":["prayer|pray|feast|food|eat|family|charity|give|gift|new clothes|clothes|sweets|greet|mosque|share"]}]}},
